{"data": [{"article": {"title": "缠论从零到实战：K线、分型、笔、线段、中枢、背驰、三类买卖点，一篇讲透"}, "author_id": "1465633108452020232", "created_at": "2026-10-25T03:25:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114196695680508046"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/article/2114…", "end": 23, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2114015256007811072", "start": 0, "status": 404, "unwound_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2114015256007811072", "url": "https://t.co/2DseGhS4ka"}]}, "id": "2114196695680508046", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 194, "impression_count": 12213, "like_count": 183, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 34, "retweet_count": 24}, "text": "https://t.co/2DseGhS4ka", "url": "https://x.com/bi_9527zx/status/2114196695680508046"}, {"author_id": "958031588", "created_at": "2026-10-25T16:46:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114398217962127368"], "id": "2114398217962127368", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "X 上的的各位大佬没有研究缠论的吗？有做缠论量化的吗？一起探讨交流啊", "url": "https://x.com/liubang8808/status/2114398217962127368"}, {"author_id": "2065684739865071616", "created_at": "2026-10-26T08:02:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114628642928271533", "2114635252639682571"], "id": "2114628642928271533", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Below is a book on Zen practice, presented alongside its original Classical Chinese text, a modern Chinese version, and an English translation. Those who do not read Chinese can simply refer to the English version.\n(Chinese translation:", "url": "https://x.com/MWGA_GCF/status/2114628642928271533"}, {"author_id": "2065684739865071616", "created_at": "2026-10-26T08:28:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114628642928271533", "2114635252639682571"], "id": "2114635252639682571", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 45, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Below is a book on Zen practice, presented alongside its original Classical Chinese text, a modern Chinese version, and an English translation. Those who do not read Chinese can simply refer to the English version.\n(Chinese translation:", "url": "https://x.com/MWGA_GCF/status/2114635252639682571"}, {"author_id": "1592938896161001472", "created_at": "2026-10-26T09:00:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114643431591149758"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/lxab6nCCEB", "end": 172, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2114643431591149758/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114643398728843264", "start": 149, "url": "https://t.co/lxab6nCCEB"}]}, "id": "2114643431591149758", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 34, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "标普500周线走势高位表现挣扎\n周四凌晨2点美联储公布利率决议\n老美中期选举临近不确定因素增加\n本周还将迎来美股本轮财报季\n10月操盘手训练营开班倒计时最后1天\n今晚19:00全网缠论公开课\n缠论拆解当下走势分类与买卖点\n锁定每周一三五免费公开课\n直播地址：微博关注《高山说缠论》\n点关注不迷路~ https://t.co/lxab6nCCEB", "url": "https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2114643431591149758"}, {"author_id": "1592938896161001472", "created_at": "2026-10-25T13:16:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114345230547964091"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/by6f8BGZRb", "end": 142, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2114345230547964091/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114345219013615616", "start": 119, "url": "https://t.co/by6f8BGZRb"}]}, "id": "2114345230547964091", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 38, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "10月操盘手训练营开课倒计时最后2天，本期训练营重点围绕缠论基础进阶教学进行，让基础比较薄弱的同学逐步形成稳定的缠论操作体系，训练一套适合自己的交易体系是一个艰难的过程，形成一套稳定盈利的交易体系更是如此，很多人会走回头路，但贵在坚持。 https://t.co/by6f8BGZRb", "url": "https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2114345230547964091"}, {"author_id": "936871715866517504", "created_at": "2026-10-25T03:05:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114191608535040048"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 9, "start": 5, "tag": "ETH"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/z62gzPhoTK", "end": 99, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/laochenjames/status/2114191608535040048/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114191176706265088", "start": 76, "url": "https://t.co/z62gzPhoTK"}, {"display_url": "x.com/laochenjames/s…", "end": 123, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/laochenjames/status/2114173006016921941", "start": 100, "url": "https://t.co/zYLepZ9bu3"}]}, "id": "2114191608535040048", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 187, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114173006016921941", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "很神奇， $ETH 的缠论止损点2358.88，今天收线价格2358.82，以太下面支撑带一共有5个低点，恰恰是收在了缠论的那个低点附近，缠师还是牛逼 https://t.co/z62gzPhoTK https://t.co/zYLepZ9bu3", "url": "https://x.com/laochenjames/status/2114191608535040048"}, {"author_id": "2099009302099009536", "created_at": "2026-10-25T03:39:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114200099429691746"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/canserdar79/st…", "end": 157, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/canserdar79/status/2113962093544112608", "start": 134, "url": "https://t.co/7CENiqT29w"}]}, "id": "2114200099429691746", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 5060, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113962093544112608", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "“汉朝亡了1800年，汉人还在；突厥汗国亡了，突厥人也还在。”是在偷换概念。中原的王朝更替是有明确且清晰的正统连续的。灭亡东汉的魏接受汉献帝受禅，明确汉历已终、天命归于魏，而西晋皇帝受禅于魏则称“而晋武承魏之统”。往后的历朝历代，中原外交中与蕃邦的对举都自称“汉”。 https://t.co/7CENiqT29w", "url": "https://x.com/statindet/status/2114200099429691746"}, {"author_id": "1190226713436753920", "created_at": "2026-10-25T20:28:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114454068970336473"], "id": "2114454068970336473", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 242, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🪖看起来或许是很温良很好说话的性格吧，但我个人认为他在亲密关系中不能说是难缠必须说是超级无敌十分难缠的级别，即使如此也还是会对🏍️表示“不希望自己被当做能够简单搞定的对象”，放心吧你已经麻烦得要死了……", "url": "https://x.com/yddd93970828/status/2114454068970336473"}, {"author_id": "1592938896161001472", "created_at": "2026-10-26T01:11:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114525316316344814"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 57, "id": "10228272", "start": 49, "username": "YouTube"}], "urls": [{"description": "-币安广场/微博：高山说缠论-专注缠论交易系统教学多年-专注币圈/股票/黄金/原油实战操作-周一至周五早8点缠论解析早课-每周...", "display_url": "youtu.be/Q4rO8AoKp5I?si…", "end": 45, "expanded_url": "https://youtu.be/Q4rO8AoKp5I?si=PLiaba1V7sXNTGGt", "images": [{"height": 360, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114525320518991872/3-GGTZ7f?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 480}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114525320518991872/3-GGTZ7f?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 22, "status": 200, "title": "《高山说缠》-今日早课之缠论解析10.26", "unwound_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?si=PLiaba1V7sXNTGGt&v=Q4rO8AoKp5I&feature=youtu.be", "url": "https://t.co/JmtDtB9IHS"}]}, "id": "2114525316316344814", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "《高山说缠》-今日早课之缠论解析10.26 https://t.co/JmtDtB9IHS 来自 @YouTube", "url": "https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2114525316316344814"}, {"author_id": "1702177500565274624", "created_at": "2026-10-25T03:28:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114197439712567471"], "id": "2114197439712567471", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 699, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "三国信息闭塞到什么程度？曹魏给死人写信劝降\n\n你以为三国是群雄逐鹿、运筹帷幄？\n\n不，三国是三个\"断网\"的村庄，互相猜对方在干嘛，猜错的比例高达80%。\n\n给你看几个真实案例，看完你会怀疑历史课本是不是在写段子。\n\n① 给死人写信劝降\n\n蜀汉的许靖、刘巴早就去世多年。", "url": "https://x.com/Noe1017_Monad/status/2114197439712567471"}, {"author_id": "1856738003450023936", "created_at": "2026-10-25T23:35:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114501171499205029"], "id": "2114501171499205029", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "深度负GAMMA环境下 NAS 100盘前用CALLWALL29216+PIVOT R1+缠论顶背驰抓顶 一抓一个准", "url": "https://x.com/syanzi719/status/2114501171499205029"}, {"author_id": "2112084592153026560", "created_at": "2026-10-25T00:30:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114152687558394164"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/1hvNY3nU5V", "end": 41, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/maoyao6688/status/2114152687558394164/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114152607594037248", "start": 18, "url": "https://t.co/1hvNY3nU5V"}]}, "id": "2114152687558394164", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "cme  BTC 走势缠论详细分析 https://t.co/1hvNY3nU5V", "url": "https://x.com/maoyao6688/status/2114152687558394164"}, {"author_id": "4677053179", "created_at": "2026-10-25T07:04:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114251684155359464"], "id": "2114251684155359464", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 453, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "我的学术脑和我的英语考试脑经常缠斗在一起。真的朋友们，考语言一定要趁早，否则当你读到博士，你的写作方式就会试图阻止你在语言考试中正常发挥\n\n比如你认为，xxx说一个观点，那么这个xxx这个人名肯定很重要对吧，但是在语言考试中，涉及到缩句，这个人名就完全不重要。还有一些数据之类的，也不重要", "url": "https://x.com/Nohomework0/status/2114251684155359464"}, {"author_id": "1584184440841859078", "created_at": "2026-10-25T03:24:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114196366738194505"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/xXUUQk104Q", "end": 41, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/zhangfang2741/status/2114196366738194505/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114196356424421376", "start": 18, "url": "https://t.co/xXUUQk104Q"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/xXUUQk104Q", "end": 41, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/zhangfang2741/status/2114196366738194505/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114196356424454145", "start": 18, "url": "https://t.co/xXUUQk104Q"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/xXUUQk104Q", "end": 41, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/zhangfang2741/status/2114196366738194505/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114196356462215168", "start": 18, "url": "https://t.co/xXUUQk104Q"}]}, "id": "2114196366738194505", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "这个在duo上的缠论结构app咋样 https://t.co/xXUUQk104Q", "url": "https://x.com/zhangfang2741/status/2114196366738194505"}, {"author_id": "2042445486741766144", "created_at": "2026-10-26T15:08:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114736040825286757"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 81, "start": 78, "tag": "缠论"}]}, "id": "2114736040825286757", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "市场中没有上帝。\n\n无论任何规模的资金，归根结底都只是市场的分力，不是合力本身。\n\n只要是分力，就要观察市场当下的反应，根据市场反应的当下选择来选择。\n\n #缠论", "url": "https://x.com/xingluoL666/status/2114736040825286757"}, {"author_id": "2114251968466350080", "created_at": "2026-10-25T14:39:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114366136607514713"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/LxFLYGBles", "end": 91, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/pn0uzd/status/2114366136607514713/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114366128319582208", "start": 68, "url": "https://t.co/LxFLYGBles"}]}, "id": "2114366136607514713", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "周末BTC综合评析：\n道氏理论确认 79168 为假跌破，属于空头陷阱；缠论底分型成型、新中枢构建，79700-80300 是二类买点 https://t.co/LxFLYGBles", "url": "https://x.com/pn0uzd/status/2114366136607514713"}, {"author_id": "925446092669489154", "created_at": "2026-10-26T05:16:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114586966473814320"], "id": "2114586966473814320", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 371, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "它爱涨多少涨多少，权当这只票不存在。\n\n缠论心法第1条：不追高。\n\n很多人亏钱，不是不懂技术，而是看着一只票飞起来，手比脑子快。追高买的不是股票，是别人的情绪。", "url": "https://x.com/InGodWeBelieveU/status/2114586966473814320"}, {"author_id": "1854761851575545856", "created_at": "2026-10-25T13:54:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114355041381261324"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/4kF6Z1XUsK", "end": 169, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/anzbYwHt1377068/status/2114355041381261324/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114355023731683330", "start": 146, "url": "https://t.co/4kF6Z1XUsK"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/4kF6Z1XUsK", "end": 169, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/anzbYwHt1377068/status/2114355041381261324/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114355023698165760", "start": 146, "url": "https://t.co/4kF6Z1XUsK"}]}, "id": "2114355041381261324", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 386, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "有人说薛平贵是渣男，还不想让他摘除渣男的头衔？\n\n肯定的说，薛平贵不是渣男\n\n但可以说王宝钏就是个扫把星\n\n梦见薛平贵是金龙化身就缠上了\n\n就连薛平贵的真龙气运都压制不住王宝钏的霉运\n\n还差点被她克死\n\n如果不是遇到了王宝钏\n\n他最少有三个结局\n\n第一，考取功名，考不中还可以继承养父的镖局 https://t.co/4kF6Z1XUsK", "url": "https://x.com/anzbYwHt1377068/status/2114355041381261324"}, {"author_id": "1691362979424751616", "created_at": "2026-10-26T09:41:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114653651499442371"], "id": "2114653651499442371", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "影响几代交易员的八大技术分析流派：\n价格行为：读懂当下走势\n道氏理论：先辨市场趋势\n威科夫：观察供需变化\n形态学：识别价格结构\n波浪理论：理解推动与调整\n缠论：拆解走势层级\n江恩理论：研究时间与价格\nICT：关注流动性与结构\n认识流派，也认识它们背后的时代。还有什么要补充的吗？", "url": "https://x.com/junhui1412/status/2114653651499442371"}, {"author_id": "1664895162961776640", "created_at": "2026-10-26T09:20:54.000Z",